WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.260
The last footprints.

00:01.997 --> 00:04.306
This valley is where people last stood on the Moon.

00:04.734 --> 00:15.429
In December 1972 two astronauts of Apollo 17, Gene Cernan and Harrison Schmitt, drove away from here, climbed into their lander, and left.

00:16.132 --> 00:21.197
For more than fifty years after that, nobody travelled further from the Earth than a space station.
